    <Notes ShowOnLoad="1" Notes="16-pin header test, 0.9 mm at 2.54 mm pitch. Both rows use the SAME recipe (100%, 400 mm/s, 16 passes, wobble 0.10). Row A drills them in order. Row B drills the odd holes then the even ones, so each hole has 5.08 mm of cool board beside it while it is cut. LIFT THE BOARD OFF THE BED. Air assist ON."/>
